            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

SPDX license identifier expression for the API itself, per OpenAPI License Object. Use schema:license at the resource (parent) level for licensing of the data. If only a URL identifier is available rather than an SPDX id, encode as a labeled link (#/$defs/Reference).
:alternativeOverrides: {"string": {"default": null}}
:jsonName: "spdx:license"</body>
