          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

an OpenAPI-aligned operation. Corresponds to one OpenAPI Operation Object; the path component of OAS Path Item is folded into schema:target/schema:urlTemplate together with the server URL.
:rdfType: ``schema:Action | schema:AssessAction | schema:ConsumeAction | schema:ControlAction | schema:CreateAction | schema:DeleteAction | schema:FindAction | schema:InteractAction | schema:MoveAction | schema:PlayAction | schema:SearchAction | schema:TransferAction | schema:UpdateAction``
:typeDefault: ``schema:Action``
:typeOptional:</body>
